[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753308\">7055B48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753364\">7210E66</a></p><p>1. Work on the fastening clips (1a) and remove the rear air outlet\nvent (1b) from the luggage compartment side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046816.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the rear air outlet vent\nin position and check that it is secure.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753364\">7210E66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753308\">7055B48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753196\">7040B10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]